{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+1)\\cdot 2x-{x}^{2}\\cdot 2x}{{({x}^{2}+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{3}+2x-2{x}^{3}}{{({x}^{2}+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x}{{({x}^{2}+1)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247914 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247915 13194139533711 true] [17592186247914 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533711 true] [17592186247914 1041 "field-1" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247914 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247915 13194139533711 true] [17592186247914 1110 #uuid "1051e7ba-f33d-556e-ae25-9fb71cdc09d8" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247915 1034 "\\frac{2x}{(x^2+1)^2}" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533711 true] [17592186247915 1111 #uuid "5f2541ad-9157-50a6-b497-5e2e74dba85d" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247917 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1089 "q-47943" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1100 "If $f(x)=\\frac{{e}^{x}}{cos⁡x},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1113 #uuid "c49bd4f2-e707-576e-bc3a-9055f28a3971" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1138 false 13194139533711 true] [17592186247916 1145 "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)={e}^{x}$ and $v(x)=cos⁡x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({e}^{x})^{′}\\cdot cos⁡x-{e}^{x}\\cdot (cos⁡x)^{′}}{(cos⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}cos⁡x+{e}^{x}sin⁡x}{(cos⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}(cos⁡x+sin⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247917 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247918 13194139533711 true] [17592186247917 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247919 13194139533711 true] [17592186247917 1000 #edb/ref 175921862