ue] [17592186247923 1138 false 13194139533711 true] [17592186247923 1145 "Let $u=sin⁡x$ and $v=x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =cos⁡x\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x(cos⁡x)-sin⁡x\\cdot (1)}{(x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{xcos⁡x-sin⁡x}{{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247925 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247926 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247927 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247928 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247929 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1041 "selection" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247927 13194139533711 true] [17592186247924 1110 #uuid "760c9074-82b8-549f-b954-59d5d57a9c31" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247925 1034 "\\frac{x(cos⁡x-sin⁡x)}{{x}^{2}}" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247925 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533711 true] [17592186247925 1111 #uuid "c3475223-11e3-5df1-b757-88c5192918ab" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247926 1034 "\\frac{xcos⁡x-sin⁡x}{x}" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247926 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533711 true] [17592186247926 1111 #uuid "18b14e45-3112-5d32-85c1-9cbefcf8849b" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247927 1034 "\\frac{xcos⁡x-sin⁡x}{{x}^{2}}" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247927 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533711 true] [17592186247927 1111 #uuid "da7c2b50-f909-56d5-9875-51c5fd7a7141" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247928 1034 "\\frac{xcos⁡x+sin⁡x}{{x}^{2}}" 13194139533711 true] [17592186247928 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533711 true] [1759218624